{"title":"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Bill walks <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/c/7acd90b4c509b85844a7fc33855fe060f2eb290f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"12\" height=\"23\" /> mile south, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/a/aba5ebc77cf1fd384c9db52779d89e0ef9b3d775.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"12\" height=\"23\" /> mile east, and finally <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/c/7acd90b4c509b85844a7fc33855fe060f2eb290f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"12\" height=\"23\" /> mile south. How many miles is he, in a direct line, from his starting point?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/7/1c7494c2c6a365ee14a0271b3df76ca5da93593a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1\\tfrac14\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1\\tfrac12\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1\\tfrac34\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"380\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have a right-angle triangle with sides 3/4 and 1. We can divide the simple pythagorean theorem identity 3,4,5 by 4 to get 3/4, 1, 5/4. This shows us the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/4/8445c1a6c876e9df65cdffddb6a939e5e21525d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{B}\\ 1\\tfrac{1}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"34\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8\" title=\"2005 AMC 8\">2005 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2005\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Pro